# Pairs with NoAcknowledgedWriteLost. A non-interleaving digest read closes the same cycle one call later.
MODULE: DigestQueuedBehindCapture
TARGET: NoAcknowledgedWriteLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the digest read queues behind the capture turn, so the timeout fails the capture
PERTURBS: AdmitDigest

--- FIND
    /\ seed' = IF DigestInterleaves \/ leafTurn # "capture" THEN "digest" ELSE "digestBlocked"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: GetChildDigestSnapshotAsync is not [AlwaysInterleave]
    /\ seed' = IF leafTurn # "capture" THEN "digest" ELSE "digestBlocked"
--- END
